1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,710
Who would like to buy this artifact ?

25
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:53,670
The City Lord's mansion is hiring a steward. Want to try ?

26
00:01:56,120 --> 00:02:00,190
250 low quality spirit stones and not one more !

27
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:02,510
Don't try to scam me !

28
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,270
The other shop

29
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:05,350
offered 300.

30
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:08,190
Don't be ungrateful !

31
00:02:08,640 --> 00:02:09,830
It's just a ginseng !

32
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,710
In our Teng Family City...

33
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,750
Shut up !

34
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:14,960
That's a thousand years old blood ginseng

35
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,430
worth at least 1 000 spirit stones !

36
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:18,790
Little Brother,

37
00:02:18,920 --> 00:02:21,030
come back ! We can negotiate !

38
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:24,790
At least 1 000 ?

39
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,950
I've never seen so many spirit stones in my life.

40
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,670
Let alone that Wang Lin kid.

41
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:32,160
Once I manage to sell this,

42
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:34,080
I bet he'll be shocked.

43
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,310
Hurry, let's go !

44
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,360
What do you want !?

45
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,040
Fighting is forbidden here !

46
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:02,110
Flying is forbidden in Teng Family City.

47
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:03,990
Didn't you know that ?

48
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:05,310
Who...

49
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:07,550
Are you the one that killed Bai Zhan ?

50
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,080
Thankfully, I reacted fast.

51
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:25,200
You're too slow.

52
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:34,870
So it was just an ambush to lure me here ?

53
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:37,360
How stupid of me

54
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,830
to only realize this now...

55
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:43,240
You're not worth all the trouble I went through to trap you.

56
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:49,190
Who are you !?

57
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:52,070
The one who'll kill you.

58
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:53,030
Is this sword a Core Formation artifact now ?

59
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:54,870
Of course,

60
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:57,000
a top-quality Core Formation artifact.

61
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:59,350
But you must be careful,

62
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:02,840
Blood Refining binds your life to this artifact.

63
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:04,870
If the sword is damaged,

64
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,880
you'll suffer a severe backlash.

65
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:10,030
What brings you here ?

66
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:11,190
Scram !

67
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:13,750
Excuse me...

68
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,560
Chase him !

69
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:30,150
Why are so many Teng Family disciples chasing me ?

70
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,270
You go this way,

71
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:38,270
I'll go that way.

72
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:38,950
Okay !

73
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:44,910
Wait,

74
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:45,710
something's wrong.

75
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:48,670
There's a flight suppression formation...

76
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:51,110
The gate is the other way.

77
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,680
Zhang Hu is still in the market...

78
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:04,350
Why is there no one here ?

79
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,400
No, it's not right.

80
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,880
Something's wrong,

81
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,880
I must quickly find Zhang Hu.

82
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:28,000
Late stage Foundation Establishment !

83
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:33,550
Smart people are troublesome,

84
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:35,750
I need to catch you myself.

85
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:38,560
Be careful !

86
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:53,520
Were you looking for your friend ?

87
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,030
Zhang...

88
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:57,790
Zhang Hu !

89
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:01,430
There is no grudge between us,

90
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:03,190
why are you so cruel ?

91
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,870
I was entrusted with this task

92
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,390
so I had to do it.

93
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:09,670
Is this Old Man Ji Mo's doing ?

94
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,030
Sorry...

95
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:16,030
Don't worry,

96
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:19,590
you'll meet him again soon.

97
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:26,870
You actually have a top quality Core Formation artifact ?

98
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:30,110
That little sword will be mine !

99
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:39,720
If you were Foundation Establishment,

100
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:41,590
we could've dueled.

101
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:44,470
It's a pity you're just a Qi Condensation brat.

102
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:06,480
Movement speed\Ntalisman

103
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:15,150
You're dead !

104
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,760
So only the Teng Family can fly here !

105
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:41,470
That bastard

106
00:08:41,560 --> 00:08:43,280
is clearly just playing with his prey.

107
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:48,630
He's got some good items.

108
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:50,870
This kid is getting interesting.

109
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,070
Shit,

110
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:11,510
my movement speed talisman is ending !

111
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:12,950
In Teng Family City,

112
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:15,990
even Core Formation cultivators can't escape me,

113
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:17,550
let alone you !

114
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,230
Go !

115
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:51,910
It looks like these lanterns

116
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:54,150
are the secret of Teng Family City's formation.

117
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:05,390
You dare to break our formation !?

118
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:17,070
Ancestor,

119
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,910
the young master can't handle this guy.

120
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,830
Junior fears he might lose this fight.

121
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:24,670
What cultivation does Li'er's target have ?

122
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:27,150
Ancestor, he is Qi Condensation.

123
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:30,430
And what is Li'er's cultivation ?

124
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:33,070
The young master is at Late stage Foundation Establishment.

125
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:36,870
Li'er lacks mental fortitude.

126
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:39,360
If this fight can temper him,

127
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:40,910
repairing this city

128
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,710
is a small price to pay.

129
00:11:02,280 --> 00:11:04,600
Thunder talisman

130
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,710
Little ant,

131
00:11:15,040 --> 00:11:17,150
being killed by my divine sword

132
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,550
is an honor !

133
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:23,990
This is bad !

134
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:21,110
He also has a teleportation artifact ?

135
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:26,560
That one will also be mine !

136
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:35,430
That sword is a Nascent Soul artifact,

137
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,990
I had to teleport you.

138
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:40,150
Senior, are you alright ?

139
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:42,160
I'm hanging on.

140
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:05,030
You're dead !

141
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,950
A defensive mirror ?

142
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:09,230
He also has a Nascent Soul defensive artifact !?

143
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:44,590
Damn it, he's doing it again !

144
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,950
Let's see how many times you can teleport !

145
00:14:07,160 --> 00:14:09,520
3 days later

146
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:14,880
I'm out of spirit liquid,

147
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,030
I need to get some more.

148
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:23,350
Little Lin, my Origin Soul's power is fading

149
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:26,630
I can only teleport you a few more times.

150
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:28,310
Hold on Senior !

151
00:14:31,520 --> 00:14:34,120
Misty Forest

152
00:14:33,400 --> 00:14:35,190
This forest is strange...

153
00:14:37,040 --> 00:14:38,070
He's catching up.

154
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:45,230
500 li to the south is the Misty Forest.

155
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:45,230
Note: 1 li = 500m

156
00:14:45,760 --> 00:14:48,310
The forest is shrouded in a fog

157
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:50,350
that blocks Divine Sense.

158
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:53,270
It's also filled with deadly beasts.

159
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,550
But the worst of all

160
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:57,070
are the Blue Thread Vines.

161
00:14:57,520 --> 00:15:01,310
Don't enter it before Core Formation.

162
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:05,310
I have a Nascent Soul artifact,

163
00:15:05,760 --> 00:15:08,070
what can this forest do to me ?

164
00:15:11,600 --> 00:15:14,510
Even that Qi Condensation brat dared to enter it.

165
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:16,430
Why should I be afraid of it ?

166
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:19,670
I will kill him today !

167
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:43,310
Blue Thread Vines !

168
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,630
Little Lin, stop !

169
00:15:50,400 --> 00:15:51,190
Stop !

170
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,470
You must resist your instincts

171
00:15:52,560 --> 00:15:54,360
and avoid fighting it with spiritual energy !

172
00:16:12,920 --> 00:16:15,070
These vines drain spiritual energy

173
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:17,230
and are extremely sensitive to blood.

174
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:19,430
If you fight back, they will tighten their grip

175
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:21,350
until they consume you.

176
00:16:24,520 --> 00:16:26,150
Fighting them head on

177
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:28,390
is suicide.

178
00:16:36,280 --> 00:16:39,070
I will get you out of here while I can still

179
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:40,750
do some teleports.

180
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:43,670
I won't run away.

181
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:47,550
If you offend me once,

182
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:49,350
I will accept it.

183
00:16:50,640 --> 00:16:52,600
But if you offend me a second time

184
00:16:52,800 --> 00:16:54,190
I'll exterminate you !

185
00:17:14,610 --> 00:17:20,250
I've been walking this path for endless years

186
00:17:17,260 --> 00:17:20,250
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

187
00:17:20,890 --> 00:17:25,850
Is it the compass of fate

188
00:17:22,730 --> 00:17:25,850
that wrote this outcome for us ?

189
00:17:26,010 --> 00:17:31,770
The heavens want to erase your existence,

190
00:17:31,890 --> 00:17:37,490
that's the obsession guiding me.

191
00:17:37,770 --> 00:17:43,090
Is this the path to uncover

192
00:17:39,650 --> 00:17:43,090
truths from falsehoods ?

193
00:17:43,370 --> 00:17:48,690
In a world of murk and shadow,

194
00:17:45,270 --> 00:17:48,690
only the flame of truth can light the way.

195
00:17:48,730 --> 00:17:54,410
Look at them all,

196
00:17:51,610 --> 00:17:54,410
being carried by the waves.

197
00:17:54,850 --> 00:17:59,050
Look at them all,

198
00:17:57,010 --> 00:17:59,050
being drowned.

199
00:17:59,130 --> 00:18:02,370
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

200
00:18:02,410 --> 00:18:05,450
I will let the world refine my soul.

201
00:18:05,580 --> 00:18:11,010
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

202
00:18:07,270 --> 00:18:11,010
I will fight.

203
00:18:11,010 --> 00:18:14,130
I'll break through the abyss of despair

204
00:18:14,130 --> 00:18:17,170
to finally learn who I really am.

205
00:18:17,170 --> 00:18:22,530
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

206
00:18:19,050 --> 00:18:22,530
I embrace this obsession.

207
00:18:22,530 --> 00:18:25,490
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

208
00:18:25,490 --> 00:18:28,290
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

209
00:18:28,290 --> 00:18:33,770
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

210
00:18:30,330 --> 00:18:33,770
I'll still fight.

211
00:18:33,970 --> 00:18:37,130
It's hard to avoid loneliness

212
00:18:37,130 --> 00:18:40,170
when you are above everyone else.

213
00:18:40,170 --> 00:18:45,850
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

214
00:18:42,490 --> 00:18:45,850
be afraid of a firefly ?
